---
layout: layouts/landing.njk
title: Contact
description: Get in touch with Eureka — phone, email, or the form. We answer every inquiry within one business day.
permalink: /contact/
hasContactForm: true
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="page-hero__title">Show us your funnel. We’ll show you the leak.</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__sub">Twenty minutes on the phone or a quick email — your call. We answer every inquiry within one business day, including the ones that turn out to not be a fit.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="differentiator__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Three ways to reach us</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Pick the one that suits.</h2>
        <p class="section-lede">All three go to the same humans. The phone is fastest during business hours; the form is best for after-hours.</p>

        <ul class="feature-list" style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">
          <li><strong style="display:block;">Call us</strong><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}" style="color: var(--accent-default);">{{ site.phone }}</a> · Mon–Fri 8a–6p MT</li>
          <li><strong style="display:block;">Email</strong><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="color: var(--accent-default);">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
          <li><strong style="display:block;">Visit</strong>{{ site.address.street }}<br>{{ site.address.city }}, {{ site.address.state }} {{ site.address.zip }}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <form class="contact-form" id="contactFormFull" novalidate>
          <div class="contact-form__row">
            <div class="contact-form__field">
              <label for="ccName">Name</label>
              <input id="ccName" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-form__field">
              <label for="ccBusiness">Business</label>
              <input id="ccBusiness" name="business" type="text" autocomplete="organization" required>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-form__row">
            <div class="contact-form__field">
              <label for="ccPhone">Phone</label>
              <input id="ccPhone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" pattern="[0-9\-\+\(\)\s\.]{10,}" required>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-form__field">
              <label for="ccEmail">Email</label>
              <input id="ccEmail" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-form__field">
            <label for="ccMessage">What can we help with?</label>
            <textarea id="ccMessage" name="message" required></textarea>
          </div>

          <label class="hp-field" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">
            Leave this field empty
            <input type="text" name="hp-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
          </label>

          {# Cloudflare Turnstile mount. data-sitekey provisioned via site.json. #}
          <div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="{{ site.turnstileSiteKey }}">
            {% if not site.turnstileSiteKey %}<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); padding: var(--space-3); text-align: center; border: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">// turnstile loads here (add sitekey)</div>{% endif %}
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Send message</button>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted">By submitting you agree to receive a response from our team. We never sell or share your information.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
